sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Admission Webhooks<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS (service-cert)
    participant HWProfile as HardwareProfile CRD
    participant ConnSecret as Connection Secrets
    participant Controller as odh-model-controller
    participant Route as OpenShift Route
    participant Kuadrant as Kuadrant API
    participant Istio as Istio (EnvoyFilter)
    participant NIM_API as NVIDIA NIM API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ModelReg as Model Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over User,Route: Flow 1: InferenceService Deployment with Route
        User->>K8sAPI: POST InferenceService<br/>Auth: kubectl credentials
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission (mutating)<br/>mTLS (webhook config)
        Webhook->>HWProfile: Resolve HardwareProfile<br/>SA token
        HWProfile-->>Webhook: Resource limits, nodeSelector,<br/>tolerations, Kueue queue
        Webhook->>ConnSecret: Read connection Secret<br/>SA token
        ConnSecret-->>Webhook: S3/URI/OCI credentials
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated InferenceService<br/>(credentials + scheduling injected)
        K8sAPI-->>User: InferenceService created

        Note over Controller: Watch event triggers reconciliation
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create OpenShift Route<br/>SA token
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: Route created
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceMonitor<br/>SA token
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create ClusterRoleBinding<br/>SA token
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicy<br/>SA token
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over User,Istio: Flow 2: LLMInferenceService with Gateway Auth
        User->>K8sAPI: POST LLMInferenceService<br/>Auth: kubectl credentials
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission (mutating)<br/>mTLS
        Webhook->>HWProfile: Resolve HardwareProfile
        Webhook->>ConnSecret: Read connection credentials
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated LLMInferenceService

        Note over Controller: LLM Controller reconciliation
        Controller->>Kuadrant: Create AuthPolicy<br/>(HTTPRoute target)<br/>SA token
        Kuadrant-->>Controller: AuthPolicy created

        Note over Controller: Gateway Controller reconciliation
        Controller->>Istio: Create EnvoyFilter<br/>(Authorino TLS bootstrap)<br/>SA token
        Istio-->>Controller: EnvoyFilter created
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create PodMonitor<br/>(Istio/Envoy metrics)
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Controller,NIM_API: Flow 3: NIM Account Lifecycle
        User->>K8sAPI: POST NIM Account<br/>Auth: kubectl credentials
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: Validate singleton<br/>(1 Account per namespace)
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admitted

        Note over Controller: NIM Controller handler chain
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Read NGC API Key Secret<br/>SA token
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: API Key
        Controller->>NIM_API: Validate API Key<br/>NGC API Key auth
        NIM_API-->>Controller: Validation result
        Controller->>NIM_API: Fetch model catalog<br/>NGC API Key auth
        NIM_API-->>Controller: NIM models list
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Pull Secret<br/>(dockerconfigjson)
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create NIM ConfigMap
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create ServingRuntime Templates
    end

    rect rgb(245, 240, 255)
        Note over User,ModelReg: Flow 4: Gateway Discovery (Dashboard)
        User->>Controller: GET /api/v1/gateways<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS (FIPS)<br/>Bearer token
        Controller->>K8sAPI: SelfSubjectAccessReview<br/>(can user create LLMISvc?)
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: Access granted
        Controller->>K8sAPI: List Gateways<br/>(filtered by RBAC + labels)
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: Gateway list
        Controller-->>User: Available gateways JSON
    end
